artifacts/training/
# Modeling runs (dataset/models/labeling per run) are regenerated. The
# presented run keeps its trained models and small results in git; its
# inputs (history, subgraphs, raw LLM answers, merge journals) stay local.
artifacts/modeling/*
!artifacts/modeling/2026-09-29-dedup/
artifacts/modeling/2026-09-29-dedup/*
!artifacts/modeling/2026-09-29-dedup/models/
!artifacts/modeling/2026-09-29-dedup/benchmark.csv
